### 4. Loss Formulation

#### [NEW] [losses.py](file:///c:/VIT_CHENNAI/Computer_science/Internship/MolGraph-AE--main/temporal_dynamics/losses.py)

```
L_total = λ_pos * L_pos
        + λ_vel * L_vel
        + λ_cons * L_consistency
        + λ_bond * L_bond
```

**Term 1 — Position MSE:**
$$\mathcal{L}_{pos} = \|x^p_{pred}(t+1) - x^p_{gt}(t+1)\|^2$$

**Term 2 — Velocity MSE:**
$$\mathcal{L}_{vel} = \|x^v_{pred}(t+1) - x^v_{gt}(t+1)\|^2$$

**Term 3 — Derivative Consistency** (prevents velocity from diverging from position delta):
$$\mathcal{L}_{cons} = \left\|\frac{x^p_{pred}(t+1) - x^p(t)}{\Delta t} - x^v_{pred}(t+1)\right\|^2$$

**Term 4 — Bond-length Penalty** (prevents unphysical bond stretching):
$$\mathcal{L}_{bond} = \sum_{(i,j) \in E_{covalent}} \left(\|x^p_{pred,i} - x^p_{pred,j}\| - d^{eq}_{ij}\right)^2$$
where $d^{eq}_{ij}$ is the equilibrium distance from the PDB topology.

